-- Part 2 (product request): HSE + contractual/procurement + financial/budget content for the
-- site-supervisor, supervision-manager and project-manager roles ("برای سمت‌های سرپرستی کارگاه و
-- سرپرست نظارت و مدیر پروژه سوالات HSE ... همچنین قراردادی و پیمانی همچنین مالی و بودجه هم اضافه
-- کن"). "سرپرست نظارت" resolves to supervision_manager (its comp_job_role_config.label_fa is
-- literally "سرپرست نظارت"); inspection_body_supervisor's label_fa is the unrelated "سرپرست نهاد
-- بازرسی", so it is not one of the three.
--
-- There is no separate CONTRACT/FINANCIAL category in comp_question_bank's check constraint, so the
-- contractual/financial questions use JUDGMENT/SCENARIO/GENERAL (per the coordinating brief) with the
-- subject made unambiguous in sub_category and in the question stem itself.
--
-- Plain VALUES + jsonb_build_array (not the nested-JSON-literal pattern used elsewhere) for
-- reliability with long free-form Persian text. 9 HSE + 10 contractual/financial per role, skewed
-- L2-L4.

insert into comp_question_bank (job_role, category, sub_category, difficulty, question_text, reference_answer, key_points, excellent_answer_indicators, common_mistakes, standard_reference) values

